    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25664" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">laevorsum</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">laevorsus</span></b> , adv.
		laevus-versum, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>on the left hand, to</i> or <i>towards
				the left</i> (post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">laevorsum vel dextrorsum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. Flor. 1, p. 340, 41</span></i>
			; cf. Paul. ex <i><span class="en">Fest. p. 117</span></i> Müll.;
					<i><span class="en">Amm. 14, 3, 2</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">laevorsus flexus itinere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 31, 10, 11 al.</span></i>
			</div>
